c={'id':'OPSKILL-C009','claim':'The relational skills supply concrete finite definitions and useful small counterexamples: monotone attribute closure, a3NF-not-BCNF FD system and a two-row lossy join. They explicitly separate relational normal forms from operational stream contracts.','evidence':[e(363,34,107),e(363,130,142),e(389,58,75),e(391,44,74)],'dependencies':['Finite typed attributes/relations and declared FD semantics.','Projected dependencies for recursive decomposition and explicit tie rules for canonical outputs.'],'limitations':['Pseudocode/reference review, not fresh runtime-owner replay.','Finite relation satisfaction does not establish schema-wide normal-form conditions.','CHECK-071 validates only the given lossy-join example.']};d={x['id']:x for x in r['claims']};d[c['id']]=c;r['claims']=list(d.values())
vp=H/(P+'_checks09.json');v={'path':'dag/reviews/'+vp.name,'sha256':hashlib.sha256(vp.read_bytes()).hexdigest(),'description':'Fourteen independent exact/path/AST controls; no retained owner invocation.'};r['validation']=[x for x in r['validation']if x['path']!=v['path']]+[v];p.write_text(json.dumps(r,indent=2)+'\n')
(H/(P+'.md')).write_text('\n'.join(['# Operad skills audit — in progress','',f"**{r['full_source_read_count']}/{r['scope_count']} full bodies reviewed; {len(r['remaining_work'])} pending.** Exact pins/ranges and individual assessments in JSON.",'',f"{len(r['claims'])} claims, {len(r['findings'])} findings;71 observed independent controls and one unavailable shell control.",'','Positive mechanisms include finite fibre witnesses, exact triangle and relational examples, complete trace-norm dual certificate conditions, MUB claim boundaries and explicit unavailable/custody policies.','','Material defects include false CPTP skew monotonicity, closedness/global-section conflations, metadata-derived evidence upgrades, dropped flat-paper extraction, stale statement dispositions and scanners whose PASS messages exceed their actual population/predicates.','','No source edits, retained workflow execution, providers or native builds. Remaining scope stays explicit.'])+'\n');print(json.dumps({'full':r['full_source_read_count'],'findings':len(r['findings'])}))
